FASTVC-BENCH-CORPUS:chromium-main-v1-943b94ae-1c74-4335-94fa-ceb4d277cea8
This page is used to check if a new panel satisfies the ChromeOS PPI(PixelPerInch)
equirement. The condition must be in sync with the spec implemented in
i/display/manager as there are several exceptions (such as we use 2.25x only for
Nocturne's 3000x2000 panel).


